%% Inference pipeline — the per-token generation loop.
%% Source ASCII: EXTRACTOR_EXPLAINED.md section 10 ("Inference pipeline").
%% On a 1B model on CPU one forward pass is ~50-200 ms, so a 600-token
%% response takes several seconds.
flowchart LR
    input["Input text"]
    tok["1. Tokenize input"]
    fwd["2. Forward pass through all layers → logits"]
    mask["3. Apply temperature + grammar mask"]
    samp["4. Sample the next token"]
    app["5. Append to output"]
    check{"max_tokens reached<br/>or stop token?"}
    done["Return generated text"]

    input --> tok --> fwd --> mask --> samp --> app --> check
    check -->|"no — keep going"| fwd
    check -->|"yes"| done
